<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Wandel &amp; Goltermann raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Wandel &amp; Goltermann raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robinson Humphrey said it raised its long-term rating on Wandel &amp; Goltermann Technologies Inc to buy from market perform and left the near-term rating at market perform.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/4 to 23-1/4 in early Nasdaq trade.</p>
</text>
